*Caliban expends {{Stat|Ability Efficiency|icon=only}}'''50''' [[energy]] to stomp the ground to unleash a shockwave of Tau energy that travels {{Stat|Ability Range|icon=only}}'''10 / 14 / 18 / 22''' meters, inflicting enemies in range and [[Line of Sight]] {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''500 / 1,000 / 1,500 / 2,000''' {{D|Tau}} damage and <u>'''1'''</u> {{D|Tau}} [[Status Effect]], raising them in aerial stasis, and applying {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''15% / 20% / 25% / 35%''' [[Damage Vulnerability]] for {{Stat|Ability Duration|icon=only}}'''4 / 6 / 8 / 10''' seconds.
**The shockwave expands from Caliban and has travel time, requiring enemies to be in sight as it passes through them.
**Enemy [[Overguard]] prevents Sentient Wrath's raising, but its other ability effects persist. Once Overguard is removed from an enemy affected by this ability, it will be raised into aerial stasis.
*'''Ability Synergy:'''
**{{A|Razor Gyre}} inflicts {{Stat|Ability Strength|icon=only}}'''400 / 600 / 800 / 1,000''' {{D|Tau}} total damage per second to enemies raised by Sentient Wrath.
**Sentient Wrath's Damage Vulnerability increases Razor Gyre, {{A|Lethal Progeny}}, and {{A|Fusion Strike}}'s damage.
*If cast in midair, Caliban will instantly drop to the ground to perform this ability.
*Can be recast, with the shockwave hitting a raised target refreshing its duration.
*Casting Sentient Wrath is a full-body animation that stops other actions and displaces Caliban to the nearest horizontal surface.
*Subsuming Caliban to the [[Helminth]] will offer Sentient Wrath and its augments to be used by other Warframes.
**However, subsumed Sentient Wrath only strikes in a frontal cone and does not inflict {{D|Tau}} status effects.
